{"name": "Eccentricity", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Eccentricity</strong> is a steampunk engineering roguelike about building the ultimate chain-reaction engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/75da5ba96b95766fe149e0d0406810e7.avif?t=1793698833\" width=\"1232\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/23787408d9fda2a1f9010e0e96d5765a.poster.avif?t=1793698833\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/23787408d9fda2a1f9010e0e96d5765a.webm?t=1793698833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/23787408d9fda2a1f9010e0e96d5765a.mp4?t=1793698833\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place machines strategically across your grid. <strong>Generators</strong> produce energy and heat. <strong>Coolers</strong> regulate temperature. <strong>Mines</strong> extract brass to be used in shops. Find the optimal placement to maximize your production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/0f91b40c544ac145304d221aee6b85b8.avif?t=1793698833\" width=\"1232\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/f0db1a508a757984b0ad8ad1dca6df9d.poster.avif?t=1793698833\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/f0db1a508a757984b0ad8ad1dca6df9d.webm?t=1793698833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/f0db1a508a757984b0ad8ad1dca6df9d.mp4?t=1793698833\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Machines trigger one by one. Sequence your machines cleverly to create the most powerful <strong>CHAIN REACTION</strong>. Multiply your output beyond limits, but always keep the temperature in check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/62031dc406c0c242200dc078f1089371.avif?t=1793698833\" width=\"1232\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/a654b0405d8b1e6a1f8d4924c8d983e7.poster.avif?t=1793698833\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/a654b0405d8b1e6a1f8d4924c8d983e7.webm?t=1793698833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/a654b0405d8b1e6a1f8d4924c8d983e7.mp4?t=1793698833\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft from 50+ unique machines across every run. Mix and match eccentric contraptions, or combine existing machines to <strong>CRAFT NEW MACHINES</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/extras/93a3c32347b5f225075c8a87add4593c.avif?t=1793698833\" width=\"1232\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day, you have 3 shifts to meet the quota. Balance long- and short-term risk by carefully managing energy, heat, brass, and space. Will you survive the scaling quotas?</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Eccentricity is a Steampunk Engineering Roguelike about building the ultimate chain-reaction machine. Carefully arrange and optimize your grid of machines to discover surprising synergies and generate as much energy as possible.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191840/b764cc44a33d2f9405836cf25709760db891efb7/header.jpg?t=1793698833", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike", "Strategy", "Resource Management", "Deckbuilding", "Steampunk", "Puzzle"], "developers": "Chefs Hat Studio", "publishers": "Chefs Hat Studio", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4191840", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/92mvaVxSmXI", "first_seen": 1793660400.0, "review_rank": 19}